  "params": {
    "comment": "The share-payload params byte packs k and n one nibble each: params = (k << 4) | n, so k = params >> 4 and n = params & 0x0F. This nibble order is vector-locked because the two PoC parsers once disagreed on it (SP-7a); a conforming parser MUST read k from the high nibble and n from the low nibble.",
